  "asserted_behavior": [
    "Native final baseline proves50 scalars for all three consumers in all engines; corrected full100 queries reach current APIs unchanged and isolate eligible targets.",
    "101-scalar queries return real HTTP422 validation_failed, keep input text and clear remote candidates without stale selection or unfiltered fallback.",
    "Repair restores current authorized selection; issue label/assignee and project lead IDs/names persist through one accepted create and reload, each at version1.",
    "Private labels and matching ineligible nonmembers remain excluded. Existing Unassigned/No lead/self choices are retained as ordinary controls, not stale remote suggestions.",
    "Focused units retain IME/modifier/focus/geometry/pagination/authority behavior; new controlled-query test verifies exact text and active-selection reset through error and repair."
  ],
  "migration_rollback": "No schema, Rust or wire change. Frontend rollback restores native query truncation; existing server bounds and authority remain unchanged.",
  "limits": [
    "Original combined-case selector failures remain retained and are not counted as cutoff proof; original ProjectLead50 evidence remains distinct from the complete final pair.",
    "Normal contained completion/namespace emptiness are verified, without forced interruption, physical/native/IME/assistive/screenshot or broader performance qualification.",
    "Only this bounded input slice is qualified. Broader feature/milestone/product acceptance and current hosted CI/integration remain lead-owned gates.",
    "No push, PR, merge or issue closure was performed. Ongoing worker Goal remains active for scoped findings and next explicit assignment."
  ]
}
